r":337,"MaqraNumber":156,"HizbNumber":39,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":28,"SurahIndex":"028","VerseNumber":39,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَٱسۡتَكۡبَرَ هُوَ وَجُنُودُهُۥ فِي ٱلۡأَرۡضِ بِغَيۡرِ ٱلۡحَقِّ وَظَنُّوٓاْ أَنَّهُمۡ إِلَيۡنَا لَا يُرۡجَعُونَ","TajweedText":"وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>سْتَكْبَرَ هُوَ وَجُنُودُهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> فِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضِ بِغَيْرِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحَقِّ وَظَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهُمْ إِلَيْنَا لَا يُرْجَع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٩</span>","End":"٣٩","PageNumber":390,"JuzNumber":20,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":337,"MaqraNumber":156,"HizbNumber":39,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":28,"SurahIndex":"028","VerseNumber":40,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَأَخَذۡنَٰهُ وَجُنُودَهُۥ فَنَبَذۡنَٰهُمۡ فِي ٱلۡيَمِّۖ فَٱنظُرۡ كَيۡفَ كَانَ عَٰقِبَةُ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","TajweedText":"فَأَخَذْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُ وَجُنُودَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> فَنَبَذْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُمْ فِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْيَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>ِ‌ۖ فَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=ikhafa>نظ</tajweed>ُرْ كَيْفَ كَانَ عَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>قِبَةُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>ظَّ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لِم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٠</span>","End":"٤٠","PageNumber":390,"JuzNumber":20,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":337,"MaqraNumber":156,"HizbNumber":39,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":28,"SurahIndex":"028","VerseNumber":41,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَجَعَلۡنَٰهُمۡ أَئِمَّةٗ